{
  "area": "admin",
  "label": "Plattform",
  "module": null,
  "permission": "platform admin (requirePlatformAdmin in admin/layout.tsx)",
  "nav": [
    {
      "label": "Organisationen",
      "key": "admin.orgs.title",
      "href": "/admin/orgs"
    },
    {
      "label": "Benutzer",
      "key": "admin.users.title",
      "href": "/admin/users"
    },
    {
      "label": "Abrechnung",
      "key": "admin.billing.title",
      "href": "/admin/billing"
    },
    {
      "label": "Rollen",
      "key": "admin.roles.title",
      "href": "/admin/roles"
    },
    {
      "label": "Aktivität",
      "key": "admin.activity.title",
      "href": "/admin/activity"
    },
    {
      "label": "API-Doku",
      "key": "admin.apiDocs",
      "href": "/api/docs"
    }
  ],
  "navNotes": "Own <AppShell> (same component as the App) with a single sidebar group 'Plattform', header item 'Zur App' (← APP_HOME), title 'Plattform'. No admin/page.tsx: /admin redirects to /admin/orgs (next.config.ts). Reached from the App sidebar link \"Plattform\" (platform admins only). Pages render no <PageHeader>: only an sr-only h1; the title comes from the shell. Content max-w-5xl.",
  "pages": [
    {
      "route": "/admin/orgs",
      "file": "src/app/admin/orgs/page.tsx",
      "title": "Organisationen",
      "purpose": "Find, create, edit, open, switch modules for, add/remove members of, trash, restore and permanently delete organisations.",
      "permission": "platform admin",
      "header": {
        "actions": [
          "Neue Organisation (button in page body, top right) → ?new=org"
        ]
      },
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "q",
          "meaning": "search name/slug"
        },
        {
          "param": "trash",
          "meaning": "1 = trashed orgs"
        },
        {
          "param": "page",
          "meaning": "Pager"
        },
        {
          "param": "new",
          "meaning": "org → create sheet"
        },
        {
          "param": "edit",
          "meaning": "org id → org drawer"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Toolbar",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "label": "Suchen…",
              "type": "search",
              "component": "SearchBox"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "Pill links 'Aktiv' / 'Papierkorb' (hand-made, not <Segments>)."
        },
        {
          "title": "Organisationen",
          "kind": "DataTable",
          "columns": [
            "Name",
            "Slug",
            "Mitglieder",
            "Angelegt / Gelöscht am (trash)"
          ],
          "notes": "Row → ?edit=<id>. Trash hint admin.trash.hint."
        }
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "param": "?new=org",
          "component": "UrlSheet",
          "title": "Neue Organisation",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "label": "Name",
              "key": "admin.orgs.name",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "slug",
              "label": "Slug",
              "key": "admin.orgs.address",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input (pattern)",
              "required": true,
              "notes": "help onboarding.addressHelp"
            },
            {
              "name": "owner",
              "label": "Inhaber (E-Mail)",
              "key": "admin.orgs.owner",
              "type": "email",
              "component": "Input",
              "notes": "empty = I become owner; unknown email gets an invite"
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "label": "Neue Organisation",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "createOrg (admin/orgs/actions.ts)",
              "result": "→ ?edit=<new id>, toast created / ownerInvited (with link) / ownerInviteNoMail"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "param": "?edit=<org id>",
          "component": "UrlSheet",
          "title": "<Org name>",
          "description": "<slug>.<root domain>",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "name",
              "label": "Name",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "slug",
              "label": "Slug",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "label": "Mitglied hinzufügen",
              "key": "admin.orgs.addMember",
              "type": "email",
              "component": "Input",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "role_id",
              "label": "Rolle",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "Sections: buttons 'Organisation öffnen' + 'Aktivität'; Details form; Module list (each with Aktiv badge, 'Wird mit aktiviert: …', Einschalten/Ausschalten); Mitglieder list with 'Entfernen' + add form; 'In den Papierkorb' (red). Trashed org: deleted/purge date, 'Wiederherstellen', Gefahrenzone with checkbox 'Ich verstehe, dass alle Daten … gelöscht werden' + 'Jetzt endgültig löschen'.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "label": "Organisation öffnen",
              "key": "admin.orgs.open",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "openOrg",
              "result": "sets active org, → App home (as platform admin)"
            },
            {
              "label": "Aktivität",
              "kind": "link",
              "target": "/admin/activity?org=<id>"
            },
            {
              "label": "Speichern",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "updateOrg",
              "confirm": false,
              "result": "toast 'Gespeichert.' (changing the slug changes the public address, no warning)"
            },
            {
              "label": "Einschalten / Ausschalten (modules.turnOn / turnOff)",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "enableModule / disableModule (module-actions.ts)",
              "confirm": false,
              "result": "toast turnedOn/turnedOff; blocked when another module requires it"
            },
            {
              "label": "Entfernen (member)",
              "key": "members.remove",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "removeMember",
              "confirm": false
            },
            {
              "label": "Hinzufügen",
              "key": "admin.orgs.add",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "addMember",
              "result": "existing account added or invite sent (toast with link)"
            },
            {
              "label": "In den Papierkorb",
              "key": "admin.trash.moveToTrash",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "trashOrg",
              "confirm": false,
              "result": "→ list, toast 'In den Papierkorb verschoben.'"
            },
            {
              "label": "Wiederherstellen",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "restoreOrg"
            },
            {
              "label": "Jetzt endgültig löschen",
              "key": "admin.trash.deleteNow",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "deleteOrg",
              "confirm": "checkbox in form (not ConfirmHost)",
              "result": "→ ?trash=1, toast 'Endgültig gelöscht.'"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        "/admin/activity?org=",
        "/ (App home after open)"
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Trashing an org, turning off modules and removing members happen without any confirm.",
        "Permanent delete uses an in-form checkbox inside a 'Gefahrenzone' box instead of data-confirm (app.md: no danger-zone boxes).",
        "Very large drawer (details + module switches + members) – app.md suggests records with real content get their own page.",
        "'Neue Organisation' is a button in the page body, not a header primary; admin pages have no PageHeader at all.",
        "Slug column header label 'Slug' vs Settings › Allgemein label 'Slug (Webseite)' showing the full domain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/admin/users",
      "file": "src/app/admin/users/page.tsx",
      "title": "Benutzer",
      "purpose": "Find accounts, edit name, grant/revoke superadmin, remove memberships, delete accounts.",
      "permission": "platform admin",
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "q",
          "meaning": "email/name search"
        },
        {
          "param": "page",
          "meaning": "Pager"
        },
        {
          "param": "edit",
          "meaning": "user id → user drawer"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Toolbar",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "label": "Suchen…",
              "type": "search",
              "component": "SearchBox"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Benutzer",
          "kind": "DataTable",
          "columns": [
            "E-Mail (+ Superadmin / unbestätigt badges)",
            "Name",
            "Organisationen",
            "Letzte Anmeldung",
            "Angelegt"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "param": "?edit=<user id>",
          "component": "UrlSheet",
          "title": "<Name or E-Mail>",
          "description": "<E-Mail>",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "full_name",
              "label": "Name",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "Sections Profil, Plattform-Zugriff (help text), Mitgliedschaften (org + role, 'Entfernen'), Gefahrenzone (not for self).",
          "actions": [
            {
              "label": "Speichern",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "updateProfile",
              "result": "toast 'Gespeichert.'"
            },
            {
              "label": "Superadmin machen / Superadmin entziehen",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "setSuperadmin",
              "confirm": false,
              "notes": "hidden for own account"
            },
            {
              "label": "Entfernen (membership)",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "removeMembership",
              "confirm": false
            },
            {
              "label": "Benutzer löschen",
              "key": "admin.users.delete",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "deleteUser",
              "confirm": "checkbox 'Ich verstehe, dass dieses Konto endgültig gelöscht wird.'"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Granting platform-wide superadmin rights has no confirm.",
        "No way to see/open a user's orgs from the drawer (org names are plain text).",
        "No create/invite user here; accounts only come from sign-up or invites."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/admin/billing",
      "file": "src/app/admin/billing/page.tsx",
      "title": "Abrechnung",
      "purpose": "Per month: what roots charges each org (subscription, usage, sales fees, discount), and set default or per-org prices from a future month on.",
      "permission": "platform admin",
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "month",
          "meaning": "YYYY-MM shown (default current)"
        },
        {
          "param": "price",
          "meaning": "default | <org id> → price sheet (wide)"
        },
        {
          "param": "error / ok",
          "meaning": "toast"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Month switcher",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "‹ / › icon buttons (aria Vorheriger/Nächster Monat), 'Monat Jahr · läuft', button 'Standardpreis' → ?price=default"
        },
        {
          "title": "Stats",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "hand-made <dl>: Fällig gesamt, Verkaufsgebühren offen, Von Stripe eingezogen, Umsatz über roots"
        },
        {
          "title": "Organisationen",
          "kind": "DataTable",
          "columns": [
            "Organisation (+ price source badge + summary)",
            "Abo",
            "Nutzer / Mitglieder",
            "Verkäufe",
            "Gebühr eingezogen",
            "Gebühr offen",
            "Rabatt",
            "Fällig"
          ],
          "notes": "Money right-aligned tabular-nums. Row → ?price=<org>. Footnote admin.billing.footnote."
        }
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "param": "?price=default | ?price=<org id>",
          "component": "UrlSheet (wide)",
          "title": "Standardpreis / <Org name>",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "month",
              "label": "Gilt ab",
              "key": "admin.billing.validFrom",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect (next 12 months)"
            },
            {
              "name": "base",
              "label": "Grundgebühr pro Monat",
              "type": "money",
              "component": "TypedInput:money"
            },
            {
              "name": "user",
              "label": "Pro Team-Nutzer",
              "type": "money",
              "component": "TypedInput:money"
            },
            {
              "name": "included_users",
              "label": "Inklusive Nutzer",
              "type": "number",
              "component": "Input inputMode=numeric"
            },
            {
              "name": "member",
              "label": "Pro aktivem Mitglied",
              "type": "money",
              "component": "TypedInput:money"
            },
            {
              "name": "included_members",
              "label": "Inklusive Mitglieder",
              "type": "number",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "module.<key>",
              "label": "Module: one money field per module",
              "type": "money",
              "component": "TypedInput:money"
            },
            {
              "name": "sales_percent",
              "label": "Prozent vom Verkauf",
              "type": "decimal",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "sales_fixed",
              "label": "Fix je Verkauf",
              "type": "money",
              "component": "TypedInput:money"
            },
            {
              "name": "discount_percent",
              "label": "Rabatt in % (100 = kostenlos)",
              "type": "number",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "note",
              "label": "Notiz",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "First card 'Preise' lists the price history (ab <Monat>: summary + note); planned (future) rows have a trash icon.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "label": "Preis speichern",
              "where": "savebar",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "savePrice (admin/billing/actions.ts)",
              "result": "toast 'Preis gespeichert.' / onlyFuture / invalidAmount"
            },
            {
              "label": "Geplanten Preis löschen",
              "where": "row",
              "kind": "confirm",
              "target": "deletePrice",
              "confirm": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "One of the few admin forms with <SaveBar always> and TypedInput:money; percentages and counts are plain Inputs.",
        "Stats are a hand-made <dl>, not <DetailList>.",
        "Month navigation via ‹ › links only; no jump to a month."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/admin/roles",
      "file": "src/app/admin/roles/page.tsx",
      "title": "Rollen",
      "purpose": "Define the global roles (names DE/EN, permissions per module) that orgs assign.",
      "permission": "platform admin",
      "header": {
        "actions": [
          "Neue Rolle (page body button) → ?new=role"
        ]
      },
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "new",
          "meaning": "role → create sheet"
        },
        {
          "param": "edit",
          "meaning": "role id → edit sheet"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Rollen",
          "kind": "DataTable",
          "columns": [
            "Name (+ Inhaber-Rolle badge)",
            "Berechtigungen (summary)",
            "Vergeben (member count)"
          ],
          "notes": "intro admin.roles.intro"
        }
      ],
      "overlays": [
        {
          "param": "?new=role | ?edit=<role id>",
          "component": "UrlSheet",
          "title": "Neue Rolle / roles.editTitle",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "name_de",
              "label": "Name (Deutsch)",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "name_en",
              "label": "Name (Englisch)",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "permissions",
              "label": "roles.fullAccess (*) + one Checkbox per permission, grouped by module",
              "type": "checkbox[]",
              "component": "Checkbox",
              "notes": "owner role: no permission list (roles.summaryOwner)"
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "label": "roles.save",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "saveRole",
              "result": "toast roles.saved; nameTaken"
            },
            {
              "label": "roles.delete",
              "kind": "serverAction",
              "target": "deleteRole",
              "confirm": false,
              "result": "roles.inUse when assigned"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Deleting a global role (affects all orgs) has no confirm; it is a red button next to Save.",
        "Editing permissions of a role changes rights in every org at once – no warning or count shown in the sheet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/admin/activity",
      "file": "src/app/admin/activity/page.tsx",
      "title": "Aktivität",
      "purpose": "Platform-wide change log of core tables, filterable by org and table, plus an 'Fehler' view of failed automation runs and failed org mails.",
      "permission": "platform admin",
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "table",
          "meaning": "table filter or 'errors'"
        },
        {
          "param": "org",
          "meaning": "org id filter"
        },
        {
          "param": "page",
          "meaning": "page number (50 per page)"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Filter chips",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "Alle, Fehler, orgs, roles, org_members, invites, org_modules, org_integrations, platform_admins, event_subscriptions, pay_orders (labels activity.tables.*). 'Gefiltert auf {org}. Alle' line when ?org."
        },
        {
          "title": "Change log",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "<ol> of <details>: action badge (angelegt/geändert/gelöscht), table, org link, changed field names, actor · time; expands to JSON before/after."
        },
        {
          "title": "Fehler",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "newest 100 failed workflow runs + failed email_log rows: kind badge, title, org link, time, error text. Empty 'Keine Fehler – alles läuft.'"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "Neuer / Älter",
          "key": "activity.newer / activity.older",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "link"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Only a fixed list of 9 core tables is filterable although the audit log covers every org table.",
        "Failed items don't link to the run/mail or the org's page; only to an org filter.",
        "Pagination uses own buttons (?page=) instead of <Pager>."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
